Server - using the desktop from another computer
================================================

This desktop can be set up on a server, so you can open it from any
computer with a web browser: at home, at work, on a borrowed laptop.
You type the server's address, sign in, and the desktop appears. This
guide says what you get, and what stays on each computer.

Contents:

